Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: arm: qcom: document ASUS ROG Phone 5

Document the existing board compatible beside the other SM8350 boards.
This changes schema metadata only; it does not change the device tree,
PSCI policy, RPMh power-domain workaround, or compiled driver behavior.

Base: 7a5cef0db4795d9d453a12e0f61b5b7634fc4d40 (Linux 7.1.4)

